WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
A pipe lies below the ground surface.

00:02.300 --> 00:05.000
The transmitter and receiver move along the survey line.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
Returning reflections are recorded at successive survey positions.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.715
The pipe produces a curved reflection in the illustrated radargram.
